{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261qZI1k5eIs1794370216.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>九龍城街頭昨晚（10日）發生乘客毆打的士司機意外。網上流傳片段顯示，事發地點位於九龍城聯合道，一名身穿白衫的男乘客站在的士車門旁，不斷向坐在駕駛席上的司機施暴揮拳，片中持續傳出沉重的聲響，場面相當混亂與驚險。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-11-11h35m21s078.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264tEP2wIRaM1794370173.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-11-11h35m18s023.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DIFsTRqDyH1794370181.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>警方接報指，事故發生於昨晚深夜11時35分。據了解，24歲姓譚的的士司機於旺角西洋菜南街接載該名男乘客前往九龍廣場，行車期間，該名乘客於車廂內吸煙，司機見狀隨即出言勸止，雙方爆發爭執，譚姓司機被打致口鼻流血受傷，涉案男子逃離現場。警方將案件列作「襲擊致身體受傷」，目前正全力追緝該名涉案男子。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:12:40.707865+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":251,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T04:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T01:40:40.326738+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T05:06:07.126028+00:00","content_hash":"74dc13b6356ac6620af0c18510c02cd5bef4323940de98138eaf82c3039fcd61","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:12:40.707865+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}